{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262vbNVo5hTp1794894399.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>據報滙控以較大折讓，出售數據中心項目貸款。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》引述消息指，貸款合共涉及180億美元，由20間銀行銀團提供，主要用作支持甲骨文於美國新墨西哥州興建數據中心。早前傳出項目或沒無法2028年如期啟用後，滙豐就把所佔3億美元貸款以約八五折出售。報道形容，做法反映金融界正重新審視與人工智能相關貸款的風險承擔。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.920466+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":153,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T05:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:54:38.247036+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T06:43:01.772078+00:00","content_hash":"2b361fa76a1098cf657fea7048d2102fc4a2010b07cb8573080af92b724aee90","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:49:41.920466+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}